        "created_at": "2015-01-11T01:08:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have to admit I've thought about it.&nbsp;<span>After all, I did design a MLP crochet pattern last year.</span></p><p>The difficult bit would be deciding on the colours, and getting the cutie marks to look perfect.</p><p>Legacy - I guess white, blue mane/tail.</p><p>Tachyon - white, red mane/tail, those red rings on her legs.</p><p>Bunker - I'd add layers of plating to bulk him up, not sure how the mane/tail would work.</p><p>AZ - similar, what to do about the mane/tail?</p><p>Wraith - got to have some purple, don't know what other colours. Tricky.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
