      {
        "id": 126762,
        "name": "torian",
        "username": "torian",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/919ad9/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-11T15:55:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Silverleaf\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/48/2332_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Silverleaf:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I have to admit I've thought about it.&nbsp;After all, I did design a MLP crochet pattern last year.The difficult bit would be deciding on the colours, and getting the cutie marks to look perfect.Legacy - I guess white, blue mane/tail.Tachyon - white, red mane/tail, those red rings on her legs.Bunker - I'd add layers of plating to bulk him up, not sure how the mane/tail would work.AZ - similar, what to do about the mane/tail?Wraith - got to have some purple, don't know what other colours. Tricky.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I'd have AZ with a black body with blue highlights and an electric blue mohawk mane and tail.</p>\n<p>Wraith, not sure about the body, but her hoofs would be purple and she'd have white wraps going up her legs and a cape going over her mane (black).</p>\n<p>Bunker is hard, but could you do occasional lines of 'bumps' (not sure how to describe it) to represent bolts? That way you could enschew a mane/tail altogether.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Also a quick suggestion about pony types. Legacy should be a pegasus. Tachyon and AZ should be unicorns. And Bunker and Wraith should be earth ponies.</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:01:16.105Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
